<title>FINLAND: Stora orders Valmet paper machine.</title>
<headline>Stora orders Valmet paper machine.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish paper machine maker Valmet Oy said in a statement on Friday it won an order worth nearly 600 million markka to supply an SC-paper machine to a Canadian unit of Sweden's Stora AB.</p>
<p>The annual capacity of the machine, due to come on stream in spring 1998, will be 350,000 tonnes, it said.  </p>
<p>The new machine for uncoated magazine paper will be delivered to Stora Forest Industries' Port Hawkesbury mill in Nova Scotia, Valmet said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
